TITLE      Total cross sections for 900 keV neutrons
AUTHOR     (W.E.Good,G.Scharff-Goldhaber)
REFERENCE  (J,PR,59,917(19),1941)
REL-REF    (A,,A.I.Leipunsky,J,SPD,3,231,1940)
           (O,14785001,W.E.Good+,J,PR,58,89(1),1940) Previous
           measurement.
INSTITUTE  (1USAUI )
INC-SOURCE (TH-BE) Radio Th+Be source
DETECTOR   (IOCH)
METHOD     Neutrons were detected by a hydrogen-filled
           ionization chamber. After having passed through the
           absorber the neutrons were slowed down in a paraffin
           sphere and then detected through the activation of a
           dysprosium target in its center.
ERR-ANALYS (DATA-ERR) No details on sources of uncertainties.
